{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/oudscomponents\/oudslistitemdata"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents"]]},"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSListItemData"},"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"roleHeading":"Structure","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSListItemData"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSListItemData"}],"platforms":[{"introducedAt":"15.0","beta":false,"unavailable":false,"name":"iOS","deprecated":false},{"introducedAt":"13.0","beta":false,"unavailable":false,"name":"macOS","deprecated":false},{"introducedAt":"16.0","beta":false,"unavailable":false,"name":"tvOS","deprecated":false},{"introducedAt":"1.0","beta":false,"unavailable":false,"name":"visionOS","deprecated":false},{"introducedAt":"11.0","beta":false,"unavailable":false,"name":"watchOS","deprecated":false}],"symbolKind":"struct","title":"OUDSListItemData","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"Components"}],"externalID":"s:14OUDSComponents16OUDSListItemDataV"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Represents the main content displayed within a list item component such as"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSStaticListItem"},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSNavigationListItem"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSListItemData","kind":"identifier"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/Navigations"]},{"content":[{"anchor":"overview","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSListItemData","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" groups all the text-based information that a list item can display:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a mandatory label (either a "},{"code":"String","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" or a custom "},{"code":"View","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"), and optional description, overline,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"extra label, and helper text, and slots."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Code-samples","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Code samples"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["    \/\/ Minimal: label only (String)","    let data = OUDSListItemData(label: \"Label\")","","    \/\/ Label with bold style","    let data = OUDSListItemData(label: \"Label\", hasBoldLabel: true)","","    \/\/ Custom view as label with accessibility label","    let data = OUDSListItemData(","        label: HStack {","            Image(systemName: \"star.fill\")","            Text(\"Custom Label\")","        },","        accessibilityLabel: \"Favorite Custom Label\"","    )","","    \/\/ Full content with text label","    let data = OUDSListItemData(","        label: \"Label\",","        hasBoldLabel: false,","        description: \"Description\",","        overline: \"Overline\",","        extraLabel: \"Extra Label\",","        helperText: \"Helper text providing guidance\"","    )","","    \/\/ Full content with custom view label","    let data = OUDSListItemData(","        label: VStack(alignment: .leading) {","            Text(\"Title\").font(.headline)","            Text(\"Subtitle\").font(.caption)","        },","        accessibilityLabel: \"Title, Subtitle\",","        description: \"Description\",","        overline: \"Overline\",","        extraLabel: \"Extra Label\",","        helperText: \"Helper text providing guidance\"","    )","","    \/\/ Overline as a user-styled rich text (AttributedString)","    \/\/ Same \"overline\" parameter name as the String variant, disambiguated by the value's type.","    let data = OUDSListItemData(","        label: \"Label\",","        overline: .from(text: \"Overline\",","                        foregroundColor: theme.colors.contentBrandPrimary.color(for: colorScheme),","                        font: someFont)","    )","","    \/\/ Usage with a static list item","    OUDSStaticListItem(data: data)","","    \/\/ Usage with a navigation list item","    OUDSNavigationListItem(data: data) {","        \/\/ Navigate to next screen","    }","","    \/\/ With slot (displayed under texts, before helper text)","    let dataWithSlot = OUDSListItemData(","        label: \"Label\",","        textSlot: OUDSListItemData.Slot { Text(\"Additional content\") },","        helperText: \"Helper text\"","    )","","    \/\/ With text slot and bottom slot (bottom slot displayed under text slot, before helper text)","    let dataWithBothSlots = OUDSListItemData(","        label: \"Label\",","        textSlot: OUDSListItemData.Slot { Text(\"Slot content\") },","        bottomSlot: OUDSListItemData.Slot { Text(\"Bottom content\") },","        helperText: \"Helper text\"","    )"],"type":"codeListing"},{"anchor":"Custom-view-label","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Custom view label"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When providing a custom view as label:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"code":"hasBoldLabel","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" property is not applicable; all styling is controlled by the provided view.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"You must provide an ","type":"text"},{"code":"accessibilityLabel","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" parameter so that Voice Over can vocalize the label.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This "},{"code":"accessibilityLabel","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is used in the combined accessibility label of the list item text container."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You must also check the accessibility of your custom views (navigation with switch control and full keyboard access, dynamic types, contrast ratios)"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"anchor":"Small-size-behavior","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Small size behavior"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When the list item is displayed in small size (via the "},{"code":".oudsListItemSize(.small)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" modifier),"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the "},{"code":"overline","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"code":"extraLabel","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" properties are "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"automatically hidden"}]},{"type":"text","text":" to ensure a compact layout."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Only the "},{"code":"label","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"description","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", and "},{"code":"helperText","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" remain visible."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"code":"bottomSlot","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is also "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"automatically hidden"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":", but the "},{"code":"textSlot","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" remains displayed."}]},{"code":["    \/\/ overline, extraLabel and bottomSlot will not be displayed","    OUDSStaticListItem(data: OUDSListItemData(","        label: \"Label\",","        overline: \"Hidden in small\",","        extraLabel: \"Also hidden in small\"","    ))","    .oudsListItemSize(.small)"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"aside","style":"note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"3.0.0"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"Since"}],"kind":"content"}],"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Structures","generated":true,"title":"Structures","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSListItemData\/Slot"]},{"anchor":"Initializers","generated":true,"title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSListItemData\/init(key:overline:tableName:bundle:hasBoldLabel:description:extraLabel:helperText:textSlot:bottomSlot:)","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSListItemData\/init(key:tableName:bundle:hasBoldLabel:description:overline:extraLabel:helperText:textSlot:bottomSlot:)","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSListItemData\/init(label:accessibilityLabel:description:overline:extraLabel:helperText:textSlot:bottomSlot:)","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSListItemData\/init(label:accessibilityLabel:overline:description:extraLabel:helperText:textSlot:bottomSlot:)","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSListItemData\/init(label:hasBoldLabel:description:overline:extraLabel:helperText:textSlot:bottomSlot:)","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSListItemData\/init(label:overline:hasBoldLabel:description:extraLabel:helperText:textSlot:bottomSlot:)"]},{"anchor":"Enumerations","generated":true,"title":"Enumerations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSListItemData\/Label"]}],"references":{"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents/Navigations":{"title":"Navigations","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Some components can be used for "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"navigation","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"images":[{"ident